This took me a while to work out, but here it is -
 
$DEFINE NETHACKOPTIONS "name:Grue,!tombstone,time,fruit:toad,restonspace,
DECGRAPHICS,!pickup,numberpad,catname:Morris,dogname:Tooth_Gnasher"

That should be in your login.com, and the above 2 lines are in one line 
of course. (News here is 80 column, EDT is 132.)

